<Base title="Text Messages | Midgett & Fite Real Estate" description="How to sign up for rental text messages from Midgett & Fite Realty, what we send, and how to stop.">
  <h1>Text messages from Midgett &amp; Fite Realty</h1>
  <h2>How to sign up</h2>
  <p>Call our office at <a href="tel:+16154443136">615-444-3136</a> and ask to be added to our rental Callback List. Our staff or our AI receptionist, Ivy, will ask you:</p>
  <blockquote>"Midgett and Fite can call or text you at this number when a rental opens up. How often varies, message and data rates may apply, and you can reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. Our privacy policy is at midgett fite dot com slash privacy. Is that okay?"</blockquote>
  <p>We only text you if you say yes. We record your answer and the date. You don't have to agree to texts to rent from us.</p>
  <h2>What we send</h2>
  <p>We call first. If we can't reach you about a rental that fits what you asked for, we send one text with the property details and our office number. For example:</p>
  <blockquote>"Midgett &amp; Fite Realty: Hi Ms. Smith, this is Ivy. You asked us to let you know when a rental opened up. 214 Oak Street, 2 bedroom, $1,150 a month, is available now. Call 615-444-3136 to see it. Reply STOP to opt out."</blockquote>
  <h2>How often</h2>
  <p>Message frequency varies with what becomes available. Message and data rates may apply.</p>
  <h2>To stop or get help</h2>
  <p>Reply STOP to any text to stop receiving them. Reply HELP for help, or call <a href="tel:+16154443136">615-444-3136</a>.</p>
  <h2>Your privacy</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your phone number or your permission to text with anyone else. Read our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  blockquote { margin:.6em 0 1em; padding:.6em 1em; border-left:4px solid var(--accent); background:#f7f5f4; }
</style>
